{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a686a6230dbc40c2197afe5bb6149008db4826e0636f986d21d5bd0b03eb8f28",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa727ac5abf7fb2d8bd7ec6c6a28ae73aeaac7bd687432e97e9c0b41005cb83e",
      "text": "从小我就喜欢大家的笑容。\n只要有人遇到困难，我就无法坐视不管。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6a670d117648ee22cf5129dd56cf045dee0dc29478dd850506036e517b6786",
      "text": "无论面对的是什么样的人，\n只要需要帮助，我就会伸出援手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316c934be4946638d13449bcfdea8864a7adcae6f2502fa063fcab7fb3daf8c0",
      "text": "虽然也曾因为这个原因被责骂过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2e4922fdb090282050d998e10108fbe3cdde7f74a361b11357b03f844013de5",
      "text": "但这就是我的本性，也没办法嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77474d2c27ae7b9331746913a881bb5f00319b368a596a93bfa677c50935b913",
      "text": "也许会让人觉得有点烦人……不过你看，\n连同这种热情在内，不是很适合当英雄吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b5be79c0108db7dec07cfad6bcdc541f508ac1870875d53793890709ffb8f07",
      "text": "喂，天道！\n数学作业是今天交吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f4b34185ff7b3414d483bdfc86a469a416f8da95573593217a861d3a0380b87",
      "text": "嗯？啊啊，是啊。\n……难不成，你小子没写？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca41f4c331463173716c3f53bd04a00702873963842363d3f054488d469d11f9",
      "text": "就是这样啊！我完全给忘了……\n求求你了天道，借我抄一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd05b96a230eb6dcb3abac2f4c8ff724adf5d5dcfbdfc84493d411d8e7101eb0",
      "text": "唔——，借你倒是无所谓，\n但全盘照抄对你也没好处啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4338f39a5f0e7717c23bab3039927df0df754f16feac97290835aaaba2bad70",
      "text": "有了，我想到了一个好主意！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
